<title>USA: OfficeMax names Rutherford CFO.</title>
<headline>OfficeMax names Rutherford CFO.</headline>
<dateline>CLEVELAND 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>OfficeMax Inc said Tuesday that it has named Jeffrey Rutherford as chief financial officer, effective July 1.</p>
<p>He replaces John Belknap, who has resigned to join an east coast retail/distribution concern, OfficeMax said.</p>
</text>
